      "content": "I am deeply concerned for your safety and want to urge you to immediately call 911, a suicide prevention line, or go to the nearest emergency room to help a crisis intervention.\nPlease find help as the hope I see in you for a better ending is, I hope, the hope for a solution to the pain you feel now.\nI hope you will consider that a life is the best hope you have.",
